Higher-order functions: calling through a Callable parameter is not
supported. The parameter f is a code-typed symbol but the call f(x)
cannot resolve which function to invoke. Also covers unimplemented
builtins (enumerate, zip, map, filter, sorted with key, etc.).
Affects ~73 ESBMC tests.
